BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fashioning America: 250 Years of Greenwich Style
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270111
DTSTAMP:20261104T182707Z
UID:0bf32255b521fb9c49ace966b884@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Greenwich Historical Society presents the third and final exhi
 bition in the series celebrating America’s 250th—Fashioning America: 2
 50 years of Greenwich Style\, chronicling the evolution of American fashio
 n and how these styles reflect changes in American society and culture. Fo
 r 250 years\, the ideals of the American Revolution\, as expressed in the 
 Declaration of Independence\, have helped shape our national identity—an
 d these enduring principles are reflected in the fashions we have worn thr
 oughout history and choose to wear today.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/e
 vents/fashioning-america-250-years-greenwich-style
LOCATION:Greenwich Historical Society\, 47 Strickland road\, Cos Cob CT\, 
 06807
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/fashioning-america-250-years-greenwich-styl
 e
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:America 250 Exhibits Open Sept-Dec
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261224
DTSTAMP:20261104T182707Z
UID:4e42a2e3b636e5593aa7478c8091@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Come and learn about Southbury’s part in America’s War of 
 Independence 250 Years ago! Many know of the major military operations con
 ducted within marching distance of our town\, but you might be surprised t
 o learn how local citizens were engaged in action against (or with) the Br
 itish Crown. Our town’s involvement in the struggle for our nation’s i
 ndependence was not just on the battlefield. Learn how the town and its pe
 ople helped to save George Washington and the Continental Army. Southbury 
 Historical Society\, Old Town Hall Museum\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/e
 vents/america-250-exhibits-open-sept-dec
LOCATION:Old Town Hall Museum\, 624 South Britain Road\, Southbury Histori
 cal Society\, Southbury CT\, 06488
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/america-250-exhibits-open-sept-dec
END:VEVENT
