 to the Arts Studio to have fun making art inspired by the River building a
 nd surrounding landscape. Learning through art\, children will think\, pla
 y\, create\, and experiment with texture\, form\, line\, color and space. 
 Led by Grace Farms Arts Educator Nancy Jameson\, Studio Beginnings provide
 s a new prompt weekly.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/studio-beginn
 ings
