BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hieroglyphs to Hype: The Modern Afterlife of Ancient Egypt
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260918
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTSTAMP:20261104T182707Z
UID:4cee5dc74f5005488862f3d393cf@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:This exhibition will explore the enduring fascination with anc
 ient Egyptian art and culture (dubbed “Egyptomania” by 19th-century Eu
 ropeans) through a selection of paintings\, prints\, photographs\, and dec
 orative art ranging from the early 19th century through the present day. T
 hese objects\, from the humble to the refined\, from the shamelessly comme
 rcial to the Afrofuturist\, represent the range of artistic responses to 
 – and misconceptions about – ancient Egyptian visual culture.\n\nSourc
 e: https://ctvisit.com/events/hieroglyphs-hype-modern-afterlife-ancient-eg
 ypt-0
LOCATION:Bellarmine Hall Galleries\, 1073 North Benson Road\, Fairfield CT
 \, 06824
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/hieroglyphs-hype-modern-afterlife-ancient-e
 gypt-0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Walktober 2026
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTSTAMP:20261104T182707Z
UID:f0975a1b427097c90589d5f9c323@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the 36th Annual Walktober in The Last Green Val
 ley National Heritage Corridor from Sept. 19 to Nov. 8. Featuring more tha
 n 250 unique hikes\, bikes\, paddles\, events and more\, Walktober is full
  of adventures for all ages! Walktober is a celebration of one of the nati
 on's oldest National Heritage Corridors\, right here in Connecticut\, in o
 ur most colorful season. We have an online guide to help you choose your a
 dventures and a printed guide too. Just give us a call or an email and we 
 can help you get one of the printed guides.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com
 /events/walktober-2026
LOCATION:The Last Green Valley National Heritage Corridor\, 203B Main St.
 \, Danielson CT\, 06239
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/walktober-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
