BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annie
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261228
DTSTAMP:20261104T182707Z
UID:ed2616def2bfcf8b4712bcac14c6@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Leapin' Lizards! The musical that stole America’s heart come
 s home to celebrate its 50th anniversary on the stage where it all began! 
 With pluck and positivity\, Annie escapes Miss Hannigan’s orphanage in s
 earch of her parents and finds a new family with her lovable mutt Sandy an
 d billionaire Oliver Warbucks. This dazzling new production bursts with jo
